|-------------|--------------|
| `CSM` | Your actual CSM implementation class. |
| `new CSM()` | The real constructor or factory call that gives you the instance you want to test. |
| `MyExpectedClass` | The class that should be injected by the caller‑sensitive method. |

That’s all you need to validate the injected invoker in a unit test!

